SOLUTION 1 River
    temp 25
    pH 6.0
    units mg/L
    Cl 10

SOLUTION 2 Seawater
    temp 25
    pH 8.1
    units mg/L
    Cl 19000

MIX 1
    1 0.7
    2 0.3

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel2.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings charge_balance
    10 PUNCH CHARGE_BALANCE
END
